Previously on Zene 'N Zeanne: Buddies Next Door - Zene was in tears as he said goodbye to his twin sister Zeanne and her friends as they head off to Junior High School! 

Hang on...if they're twins, why is Zeanne at a higher grade level than Zene is? 

For starters, it's because Zene has autism. But this can also help explain why Zeanne decided to start a Pre-K diary on a pink notebook, why Zene and Zeanne decided to become Pre-K teachers after college, and ultimately, why Kali got the smartwatch from Zene and Zeanne in the first place!

